# A file starting with #! is a program (S5), even when it names l:, so
# defining an l: name is MC8 row 9 (X_eTaL-games' ask), not a library.
== SOURCE
#!/usr/bin/env xetal
l:x := 3
l:x + 1
== ERROR
error[library-name-in-program]: l: names exist only inside a library; import it with an alias at 21..24
